          "skill": "form-structure-and-sense",
          "passage": "Working at the Peabody Museum, the archaeologist Tatiana Proskouriakoff transformed the study of Maya hieroglyphs by treating dated monuments as records of dynastic history rather than purely ritual cycles. Her 1960 study of Piedras Negras showed that successive clusters of dates on the site's stelae corresponded to the births, accessions, and ______ of individual rulers, demonstrating that the inscriptions encoded biographical timelines.",
